50e25e7cf736e557f399484d13.webm?t=1769614896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407830/extras/0c2d8650e25e7cf736e557f399484d13.mp4?t=1769614896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of Trinkets and Accessories with 1000s of combinations and variations to find, clean, upcycle, sell and collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Tools to buy, upgrade and use across 3 Trinket-care minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make life easier with the Coffee Pot, Soak Tub, and other handy gadgets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your shop with shelves, storage, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 distinct locations to visit and sell in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your shop with cosmetics covering bedclothes, wallpapers, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 unique NPC characters to get to know and sell to </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Quests to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >34 Achievements to earn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ hours of story content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless randomised customers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless gameplay</p></li></ul>","developers":["Spilt Milk Studios Ltd"],"dlc":[3710960,4148980,3710970,3711000],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407830/header.jpg?t=1769614896","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Trash Goblin \u00a9 Spilt Milk Studios 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2407830/1886262116/94dc18a9407e1e4caae0c8dbc660dd243b7079cb/1763649284